<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight rates wider, 1-week narrows.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight rates wider, 1-week narrows.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound widened on Monday in a flush market to between 10 and 10-1/4 percent from Sunday's 10-1/4 percent range, bankers said. in case the central bank accepts their bids to buy 182-day T-bills, which were auctioned on Monday.</p>
<p>One-week rates narrowed to between 10-1/8 percent from 10 and 10-1/4 percent on Sunday.</p>
<p>Public sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rates at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
